:\n\n```json\n    {\n    \"answer_q1\": \"<Respond to the Question 1 with the corresponding letter numbering>\",\n\"answer_q2\": \"<Respond to the Question 2 with the corresponding letter numbering>\"\n\n    }\n``` \n    \n\n## Scenario\nJoanne was pretty and likable. She hoped that she could find a partner on her terms. However, she kept receiving love letters from anonymous admirers. Every morning, she would see the letters piling in her school locker. She took a deep breath and counted to five before smiling and going to the class.\n\n## Question 1\nWhat emotion(s) would Joanne ultimately feel in this situation?\n\n## Choices for Question 1\nA) Annoyance\nB) Guilt\nC) Joy\nD) Pride\nE) Admiration\nF) Excitement\n\n## Question 2\nWhy would Joanne feel these emotions in this situation?\n\n## Choices for Question 2\nA) She receives love letters from anonymous admirers although she wants to find a partner on her own\nB) She doesn't like receiving any form of letters\nC) She doesn't find anyone likable in her school\nD) She enjoys having many admirers","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","promptTraceId":"ca191388276745ca943150cac3bdfbbb","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.014063624563840029,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6afa7ab64a7028114331c428","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794800310666,"createTime":"2026-11-16 11:38:30","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"59787df4ce57446d9fa798ed05343f1e"}